//      E X T E N D E D  _  C A N S L I M  _  I N D I C A T O R\
//\
//      Extensive Fundamental and Technical indicators for the CANSLIM Trader !\
//\
//      Displays The following mostly Fundamental CANSLIM data :\
//\
//      01. C = EPS diluted growth quarterly YoY.\
//      02. A = EPS diluted growth Annual YoY.\
//      03. N = New High as best effort.\
//      04. S = Float shares as Best effort.\
//      05. L  = One year performance relative to S&P 500, custom.\
//            Positive Performance: 0% .. 50% = Neutral, 50%+ = Leader, 80%+ = Leader+, 100%+ = Leader++\
//             Negative Performance: 0% .. -10% = Laggard, -10% .. -30% = Laggard+, -30%+ = Laggard++\
//      06. I    = Accumulation/Distribution days over the last 25 days, best effort for institutional clues.\
//      07. M     = Market direction gauges on S&P500 closing between averages.\
// \
//      08. RS      = Approximate Relative Strength as per IBD.\
//      09. Rev.     = Revenue growth quarterly YoY.\
//      10. ROE       = Return on equity quarterly YoY.\
//      11. Piotr.     = Piotroski Score, https://www.investopedia.com/terms/p/piotroski-score.asp\
//      12. ATR%        = Average True Range over the last 20 days.\
//      13. Trend Days  = Days since EMA50 is over E200.\
//      14. D. to E.    = Days to Earnings, Avoid buying just before earnings.\
//      15. Avg Vol.    = 50d Average Volume.\
//      16. Vol. Today  = Today's percentage volume compared to 50 days average.\
//\
//      Along with the independently actionable technical indicators:\
//\
//      01. Four Daily Simple Moving Averages for 20, 50, 100, 200 automatically scaled also on the weekly time frame.\
//      02. 52 Week high, shows a sun on new 52 week high.\
//      03. Pocket Pivots.\
//      04. Base Locator, Formerly Darvas Boxes.\
//      05. Market Exposure.\
//      06. Follow Through days calculated on the S&P 500 Index.\
//      07. Relative Strength Line and Rating.\
//      08. Earnings Line.\
//      09. ATR Bands.\
//      10. Highest Volume TTM and Ever.\
//      11. MAs Alignment.\
//      12. 3 Weeks Tight with base coherence check.\
//      13. Market Cycle (Dynamic View only)\
//      14. Base Counter.\
//      15. Consecutive positive Earnings and Revenue Counters.\
//      16. Earnings Acceleration.\
//\
//      \uc0\u10019  \u10019  \u10019 \
//\
//      The indicator offers 2 different views, Static and Dynamic.\
//      The static view provides a complete view of current and past fundamental data while the dynamic one is more a portable device compatible view\
//      showing the main fundamental information for past quarters along with the status of the last quarter.\
//\
//      Note on calculating EPS Growth.\
//      Contrary to other applications, TV does not provide growth information when transitioning from a negative losing quarter to a positive\
//      profitable one. Those quarters are calculated using the formula: ((cq - (-pq)) / |-pq|) \'d7 100, where cq = current quarter and pq = previous quarter.\
//      The obtained value is marked with a "!" and should be interpreted as a magnitude of improvement and not traditional growth! The company has moved from a loss to a profit,\
//      which is qualitatively different from growing from one positive quarter to another.\
//\
//      \uc0\u10019  \u10019  \u10019  Version 16 Improvements\
//          Made the Acc/Dist TABLE a bit shorter.\
//          Fixed CANSLIM boxes misplacement in dynamic mode.\
//          Distribution days are now identified in daily view on Indexes.\
//          Removed non useful indicators on indexes (Earnings Accel/Pocket pivots/High Volumes/3 Week Tight).\
//          C number displays transitional (!) and losing quarters (()) marks in dynamic mode.\
//          Added negative and transitional colors to Earnings and Sales numbers in dynamic mode.\
//          Added Earnings announcement marker.\
//          Bases can use separate periods (min bars) for Daily and Weekly time frames.\
//          Base counter for indexes use 7% increase for increment instead of 20%\
//\
//      \uc0\u10019  \u10019  \u10019  Version 17 Improvements\
//          Custom User color set.\
//          Relative Strength labels at price swings Indicator.\
//          Moving average selection between Simple or Exponential (default).\
//          Count of Positive ROE quarters. \
//          Description tooltips on all header columns and some other table elements.\
//          Description tooltips on most chart indication labels.\
//          CRO Qualified Indication for (C), (R)evenue and R(O)e, instead of only Qualified/Non qualified indication.\
//          Additional MA 10.\
//          Static table is vertically aligned on the pane.\
//          \'93Colossus\'94 nick name indication for the 1 trillion+ market cap companies.\
//          Additional \'93Nano\'94 size set for ultra small portable devices.\
//\
//      \uc0\u10019  \u10019  \u10019  Version 18 Improvements/Changes\
//          Base Count Reset on MA200 breach rather than MA100\
//          Analytical Option on Dynamic View\
//          Fixed Quarter Acceleration Indicator\
//          Improved execution speed.\
//          Added X-CANSLIM Stock Ranking.\
//\
