                    "to identify stocks with a strong upward move.\\n"+\
                    "Stocks receive a composite score (0-99) based on these weighted factors. Higher scores indicate stocks with strong fundamentals that are demonstrating "+\
                    "positive technical performance." )\
        COL += 1\
\
        if showXtra\
